166
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:24,614
Hey, how you doing?

167
00:07:24,648 --> 00:07:25,949
Fine.

168
00:07:25,983 --> 00:07:28,284
My dad was never there
for me when he was alive,

169
00:07:28,319 --> 00:07:29,999
