189
00:08:29,980 --> 00:08:31,614
So, yeah, there's that.

190
00:08:31,649 --> 00:08:34,117
Oh, I'm sorry
to hear about that.

191
00:08:34,151 --> 00:08:35,585
Thanks, but I didn't really...

192
